  data: {
    LLM: "Always ask for ranks you actually hold (it's the rules!). Start by asking for ranks where you already have 2 or 3 cards to finish books quickly.\n\nListen! If Bob asks Alice for Kings, Bob has at least one King. If Alice says 'Go Fish', she has no Kings. Remember this.\n\nThe Steal: If Bob asks Alice for Kings and she gives him one, you *know* Bob has Kings. On your turn, if you have a King, ask Bob for his Kings to steal them all before he can complete the book.",
    Player: "Always ask for ranks you actually hold (it's the rules!). Start by asking for ranks where you already have 2 or 3 cards to finish books quickly.\n\nListen! If Bob asks Alice for Kings, Bob has at least one King. If Alice says 'Go Fish', she has no Kings. Remember this.\n\nThe Steal: If Bob asks Alice for Kings and she gives him one, you *know* Bob has Kings. On your turn, if you have a King, ask Bob for his Kings to steal them all before he can complete the book.",
