    advanced: 'The Steal: If Bob asks Alice for Kings and she gives him one, you *know* Bob has Kings. On your turn, if you have a King, ask Bob for his Kings to steal them all before he can complete the book.',
    tips: [
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "Don't sort your hand too obviously if playing with sharp-eyed opponents.",
      },
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "In a 2-player game, card counting is powerful. If you know your opponent doesn't have 7s (because they fished earlier), don't ask for them.",
